  "description": "The Shift S3 is an excellent full suspension performer for Trail riding. With its 1x transmission, the 27.5\" Shift S3 offers a wider gearing ratio for easier climbing. Its X6 alloy frame with tapered head tube and 120mm of travel features a simple and efficient single pivot suspension design, which allows for an easy and low-cost maintenance. The Suntour Raidon XC air fork and rear shock suspension package provides 120mm of travel while the new 1x Shimano Deore drive-train with a Deore 11-46T 10-speed cassette is matched to a Suntour Zeron 30T crankset for a wider gearing choice. Last but not least, efficient stopping is provided by a set of Shimano MT-200 disc brakes complete with 180/160mm rotors.",
